    "title": "Final Day to Vote for Dothan's Favorites - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Wiregrass Daily News ,\n16 hours ago DOTHAN, Ala. — Today marks the final opportunity to cast your vote in the first ever Dothan’s Favorites, where the Wiregrass community decides which local businesses deserve top honors. From favorite restaurants and boutiques to trusted service providers and healthcare professionals, this community-driven contest celebrates the businesses that make Dothan a special place to live, work, and visit. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
